module-help "
LIBXSMM is high performance library for small dense and sparse linear algebra
operations incl. GEMM and elementwise primities often seen in deep learning
applications. It also serves as reference implementation of Tensor Processing
Primitives (TPP), a programming abstraction for efficient and portable deep
learning and HPC workloads.
"
